---

---

<section id="inicio" class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-4 pb-10 pt-8 sm:px-6 sm:pb-12 sm:pt-10 lg:min-h-[calc(100svh-72px)] lg:grid-cols-[0.98fr_1.02fr] lg:items-center lg:px-8 lg:py-8"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
      <p
        class="soft-enter mb-3 inline-flex w-fit rounded-full border border-[#E1B78F] bg-white/55 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#C06445]"
      >
        Dia dos Namorados Casa Nacoli
      </p>
      <h1
        class="soft-enter delay-100 text-4xl font-black leading-[1.05] text-[#703D25] sm:text-5xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl"
      >
        O amor está no ar, e a Casa Nacoli preparou presentes incríveis para o
        seu amor.
      </h1>
      <p class="soft-enter delay-200 mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-[#67432f] sm:text-lg">
        Monte uma cesta especial, ou presente personalizado, deixando esse dia
        ainda mais inesquecível.
      </p>
      <ul
        class="mt-4 grid max-w-xl gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#703D25] sm:grid-cols-2"
      >
        <li
          class="soft-enter delay-300 rounded-2xl border border-[#E1B78F]/70 bg-white/60 px-4 py-2.5 transition hover:bg-white hover:border-[#E1B78F] hover:shadow-sm"
        >
          Itens totalmente personalizaveis
        </li>
        <li
          class="soft-enter delay-400 rounded-2xl border border-[#E1B78F]/70 bg-white/60 px-4 py-2.5 transition hover:bg-white hover:border-[#E1B78F] hover:shadow-sm"
        >
          Produtos pensados com carinho
        </li>
        <li
          class="soft-enter delay-500 rounded-2xl border border-[#E1B78F]/70 bg-white/60 px-4 py-2.5 transition hover:bg-white hover:border-[#E1B78F] hover:shadow-sm"
        >
          Atendimento direto
        </li>
        <li
          class="soft-enter delay-600 rounded-2xl border border-[#E1B78F]/70 bg-white/60 px-4 py-2.5 transition hover:bg-white hover:border-[#E1B78F] hover:shadow-sm"
        >
          Produção sob encomenda
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="soft-enter delay-700 mt-5 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a
          class="focus-ring inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#C06445] px-6 text-base font-black text-white shadow-xl shadow-[#C06445]/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-[#a94f34] hover:shadow-[#C06445]/30"
          href="#cesta"
        >
          Montar minha cesta
        </a>
        <a
          class="focus-ring inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#703D25] bg-white/50 px-6 text-base font-black text-[#703D25] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#703D25]/5"
          href="#produtos"
        >
          Ver personalizados
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="soft-enter delay-700 mt-4 max-w-lg text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-[#7c5942]">
        Não encontrou o item perfeito? Chame a gente no WhatsApp e vamos montar
        o presente ideal juntos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="soft-enter delay-300 animate-float relative min-h-[320px] sm:min-h-[360px] lg:h-[clamp(340px,58svh,500px)] lg:min-h-0"
    >
      <div
        class="paper-panel absolute inset-x-2 top-4 h-[88%] rotate-[-2deg] rounded-[2rem] border border-white/70"
      >
      </div>
      <img
        src="/assets/valentines-2026/hero.webp"
        alt="Presentes personalizados artesanais para Dia dos Namorados"
        class="relative z-10 h-full w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover shadow-2xl shadow-[#703D25]/20 transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.01]"
        width="720"
        height="720"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
